    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not Remaster, Reboot!</h2><br>Distant Realm is originally an adventure game from 2006, combined with role-playing elements. Take control of a young man who has lost his memory upon crashing to a foreign world. Explore the island, clear dungeons, find loot, buy a farm and grow tomatoes. Your call.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Overhaul of backgrounds, while keeping the feel of the authentic look<br></li><li>New Dungeons &amp; New Enemies!<br></li><li>Hero movement and animation is now realistic<br></li><li>Replacing arrow controls with the modern WASD scheme<br></li><li>Introduction of hotkeys to make selections easier<br></li><li>Improved HUD and all the text<br></li><li>Improved dialogue with slightly better humor</li></ul>",
